# because Zig refuses an import escaping the root file's directory -- so one module stands at up to
# four tracked paths. Measured `20260910.004524`: 230 of 1,964 `.rye` paths are symlinks (11.7%), 4
# of amphora's 11 (36%). The bill: README.md published 1964 modules where 1,734 exist, a 13.3%
# overstatement on the front door in the number a reader divides the witness count by; and two
# equinox scans asserted floors of 9 and 10 amphora files against populations of 7 and 8, calibrated
# on the inflated reading, so repairing the count made them refuse the truth. The cure was already
# written twice with its reason in a comment, in the two Rye ASCII meters -- a lantern that fires
# twice becomes a loom. Held at ZERO: every instance was repaired on the seating lap, and a glob no
# symlink answers is read past, so it becomes a finding on the lap a link lands under it.
guard link_counted
path tools/l/link_counted_witness.rish
tier lap
seated 20260910.004524

