# broke a seal, a stamp, or the chunk assembler would have shipped green, because nothing was
# listening -- and the chunk assembler stayed that way until the crossing rows landed. That is
# REDS %360's population exactly -- a guard that is never run guards nothing -- one family at a time.
#
