# graph in 36 components of ONE POINT EACH at 5% occupancy, all 840 ordered pairs unreachable; the
# same counter over a breadth-first numbering leaves it whole, with 85% of pairs arriving. The
# mechanism is a theorem the scan checks by counting edges rather than trusting: the 120 lexicographic
# ranks with a1 = 1 are an independent set, since every star generator swaps position 1 with some j.
# The three coordinate shapes read prefix_edgeless_max=1 and that mirror is load-bearing -- a leg
