# at 16 leaves, so mantra/recall_tablecloth_hit_census.rye walks the space whole -- a saturated
# catalog per shape, the worst case proven rather than projected. It reads 2 of 31 shapes bounded to
# one hit, exactly those naming the uniqueness key `append_leaf` enforces, and 29 reaching past the
# wire's 8. WHAT IT FOUND ON THE WAY: `max_wire_hits` declares a ceiling in HITS where the wire's
# bound is 340 BYTES, so `build_response` builds three hits inside the declared eight and
# `encode_response` refuses them on the next call (REDS, stamp `20260909.213236`). WHY THE CONTROL
# CARRIES THE GATE:
